WEBVTT

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:37.360
There's a squiddle rain starting.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:41.110
Oh yeah, a typhoon is on the way.

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:43.360
I hope it misses us, but I doubt it.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:44.170
What?

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:44.950
Man!

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:48.000
I wanted to go do my
homework drawing.

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:49.790
Just give up.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:53.320
No, I just got motivated to do it!

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:55.010
Oh, I know.

00:01:56.990 --> 00:02:00.010
<b>Isn't that a Teru Teru bosquid?</b>

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:02.760
Ball this up and...

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:06.130
Takeru, what the squid
are you doing?

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:11.190
Oh this? I guess you wouldn't know.

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:14.020
It's a teru teru bozu,
so we'll have good weather.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:16.100
It's creepy that it's smiling

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:18.410
even though it's strung
up by its neck.

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:20.570
Don't say stuff like that.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.120
It's basically a charm.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:25.450
A charm? Does that do anything?

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:28.750
When you hang these
up, the rain stops.

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:32.740
Please make the weather
nice soon.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:36.300
Ah man, I don't have anything
to do because of the weather.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.840
You can still do your homework,
even if it's raining.

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:43.020
It doesn't have to be
a landscape, right?

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:45.670
That's right, Takeru.
Stop making excuses.

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:49.170
Come on! Well, then will
you be my model?

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:53.700
If we draw a person,
it has to be someone from the family.

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:55.410
Who should it be?

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:59.150
Oh, but then there's a much
better model than us.

00:02:59.150 --> 00:02:59.780
Huh?

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.630
This is squidding hard.

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:04.900
What are you making?

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:06.570
I told you it needs to
be a family member.

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:07.980
What are you talking about?

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:12.170
She's basically family.
Right, Squid Girl?

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:16.670
Okay, Squid Girlie,
don't move while I'm drawing.

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:19.420
Got it...

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:35.670
Takeru.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:36.490
Don't move!

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.860
This is no good!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.940
Sorry, Squid Girlie,
I have to start over.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:47.700
No squidding way!

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:52.060
How am I supposed to sit still
without doing anything?!

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:54.750
It's my turn to draw you now!

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:56.660
Here!

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:57.920
What is that?

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:01.710
Oh, I see. You're joking.

00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:03.680
Where ink is concerned,
I'm always serious!

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:08.570
Squid Girl, can you draw
with your tentacles?

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.310
I guess I could do that.

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:15.060
This is good...

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:17.660
It's kind of in another dimension...

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.690
Do you think they'd find
out if I submitted this?

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.760
It has to be family right?

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.780
What good would a
self portrait do?

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:28.990
Squid Girl, since you're so good,
will you draw us, too?

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:37.340
Takeru's face is simple,
but you two will be quite difficult.

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:39.000
That's a pretty mean thing to say.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:40.500
Chizuru.

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:43.970
Eiko.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:45.870
Why?

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:47.840
My tentacles are very sensitive,

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:50.450
so can't help but reproduce
the true image.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:53.360
What is going on in your head
that I look like this?

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:55.960
And Takeru is so normal.

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:58.410
Takeru just doesn't have
any distinguishing traits.

00:04:58.410 --> 00:04:59.360
What?!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.940
So how do the others look?

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.570
You want me to ink them too?

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.960
This is Goro.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:07.550
That's a swim cap.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:09.630
This is Nagisa.

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:11.280
It's blinding!

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:12.870
Sanae.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:15.470
That's Sanae of the Dead!

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:18.340
I think Cindy's something like this.

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:20.340
I guess she's in the same
category as Sanae.

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:22.520
Sanae will probably
cry if she sees this.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:25.140
I think she might actually like it.

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:27.510
Wait, Takeru's supposed
to be drawing.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.280
My heart's broken.

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:30.510
Oh boy.

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:34.620
Squid Girl, why don't you model
for him one more time?

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:38.980
Mehhh. Hmm, okay fine.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:45.650
I'm done, but it kinda
looks like a manga.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.850
No, this is fine.

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:48.480
Yes.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.830
My face isn't that squidding simplistic!

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:53.070
No, this is quite accurate.

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:57.440
Oh yeah, what happens when
you draw yourself?

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:59.640
Draw myself?

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:06.160
I really don't get your squid style.

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:08.610
Art is difficult to understand.

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:11.180
Is that... "art", too?

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:13.690
It looks like trash to me.

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:16.170
What?! You imbecile!

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:20.350
Takeru, show her how to make
a proper teru teru bozu.

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:23.890
Draw the face and done.

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:25.970
Oh, that's pretty cute.

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:27.930
Squid Girl, what about yours?

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:33.760
When I was tying up their necks,

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.880
their emotions kind
of came to me.

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:38.750
I don't think those will be able
to make the rain stop.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:43.270
Then I'll become a teru
teru bozu myself!

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:47.290
So what does a teru teru
bozu have to do?

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.660
Well, first you have to
stand by the window.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.760
Then you smile!

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:54.220
Smile!

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:57.810
Then you stay still until
the rain ends.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.280
Got it!

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:08.310
Do I still have to squidly stay here?

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.480
Squid Girlie, it's time for bed soon.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:12.780
What about the rain?

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.580
I guess it got even worse.

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:19.120
Ugh, but I was trying
so hard to stay still!

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:22.520
I guess I have to go all the
way and hang myself.

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:23.880
Squid Girlie, that's fine!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:25.940
But...

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:28.050
Don't worry about it.

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:33.050
Teru teru bozus are nothing
but a charm anyway.

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:38.280
Takeru... at this rate he'll become
a disillusioned child.

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:41.020
Kids need to have dreams
to believe in!

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:43.110
Takeru, it'll be okay!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:47.660
The teru teru bozu will
watch over you!

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:49.430
Uh, okay.

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:20.360
Man, it's too loud to sleep.

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:22.730
Huh? What is this?

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:40.230
So it's sunny outside, but we had
a very localized downpour?

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:42.630
See, just like I said.

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:44.560
Everything you did
was superfluous!

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:48.790
My name is Nagatsuki Sanae.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:52.350
I am a shy, introverted
high school girl.

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:55.980
My best friend Eiko says
that I'm an airhead.

00:08:55.980 --> 00:09:00.600
That's me, but now I'm
in love with someone!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.890
Oh, I'm so embarrassed!

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:03.600
Squiddie!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.730
Squiddie!

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:16.300
Squidd-ie...

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:19.570
Hey, what the hell?!

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:26.210
Sanae, stop chasing
after Squid Girl.

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:29.110
Huh? What's that supposed
to mean?

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:33.000
Are you saying that Squiddie's
yours now?!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.550
When did that happen?!

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:36.730
I won't allow that! Never!

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:38.550
Why would I do that?

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:41.220
I'm saying this for your sake.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:44.520
I'm not telling you to stay away
from her completely.

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:49.740
You do know what Squid
Girl thinks of you, right?

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:55.820
Of course. I mean, we understand
each other completely.

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:03.890
I think - no I'm sure - that she
thinks you're annoying.

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:04.880
Why?!

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:08.320
What do you mean "why"?

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:09.620
I didn't know.

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:11.980
As your best friend,

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:15.840
I simply don't want to see you
treated so coldly by her.

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:19.090
That's why you have to abstain
from Squid Girl!

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:22.550
Abstain from Squiddie?!

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:27.560
<b>What squidsn't there to like?</b>

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:32.940
Welc-- Sanae!

00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:35.280
Good morning, Squiddie.

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:36.980
Huh?

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.530
First, you have to stop
being so high-strung.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:44.560
I'm high-strung?

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:46.810
It's pretty bad when you
don't realize it yourself.

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:48.990
You know how cats and dogs

00:10:48.990 --> 00:10:51.680
don't like high-strung kids because
they're so unpredictable?

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:53.380
Same thing here.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:57.130
Keep your conversations
cool and casual.

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:01.340
Breakfast was too small.

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:05.310
Do you want some shrimp?
I haven't touched them yet.

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:07.560
Keep your niceties casual as well.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:10.280
Th-thanks?

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:16.580
Nice weather today, huh?

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:19.360
Always stay out of her one meter
sphere of personal space!

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:27.980
No pictures!

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:33.000
For banishing desires of the flesh

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:00.740
This is no good.
This isn't enough...

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:21.840
Squiddie...

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:25.760
Squidd-

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.770
What's wrong, Squiddie?

00:12:52.080 --> 00:13:03.860
Squiii...

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:06.300
Recycle Bin

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:06.300
<b>Squiddie
Squiddie2
Squiddie3
Squiddie4
Squiddie5
Squiddie6</b>

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:14.680
<b>Warning!
If you use the
"Empty recycle bin" function,
all items in the recycle bin
will be permanently erased.
Do you want to continue?

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:29.470
Good bye, Squiddie.
Good bye, my love...

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:36.750
Good morning.

00:13:37.990 --> 00:13:40.240
G-good morning...

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:45.010
Sanae doesn't feel threatening
at squidly all now.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.550
Good job, Sanae!

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:04.750
Good morning, Sanae.

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:06.370
Good morning, Squiddie.

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:13.080
Squiddie initiated physical
contact with her hand!

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:17.570
Well done, Sanae.
She's comfortable around you now.

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:19.290
Y-Yeah...

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:24.920
I should be happy that Squiddie
doesn't dislike me,

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.760
but something's missing.

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.980
What is it?

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:45.830
What are you doing?!

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:49.450
We worked so hard to make
her stop distrusting you!

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:52.620
Going through that process
again will be tough.

00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:57.620
Man, I give up.

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:01.410
So... happy...

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:07.920
The weather's great today!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.190
What, really?!

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:11.630
Kiyomi?

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:13.220
I see.

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:14.530
Well, I hope it'll get better soon.

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:18.110
Oh man, this is bad.

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:20.030
What's squidly bad?

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:21.600
Squiddie!

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:27.110
<b>One! Two! Three squids, you're out!</b>

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:28.660
Baseball?

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:31.280
You mean that thing they
show on TV sometimes?

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:36.700
Yeah. We have a practice
game now,

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.990
but our pitcher got a
fever and can't play.

00:15:39.990 --> 00:15:42.750
Our team barely has enough people

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.510
and the other team's already
on their way...

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.460
Then I'll lend you a tentacle!

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:55.260
Um, this is my friend and she'll
play baseball with us today.

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:56.970
My name is Squid Girl!

00:15:57.270 --> 00:15:59.430
Nice to meet you!

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.520
All right, here I go.

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:07.940
Kiyomi, one more time, please.

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:14.790
It's usually like this when you start.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:19.450
Next, catch it with this glove.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:26.020
Are you okay?!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.750
It hurts.

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:31.490
Seriously?

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:35.180
We have to play against a
team with a total noob?

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:38.260
We will now begin the
match between

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:40.630
Daisagami Middle School
and Hase Middle School.

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:41.990
Bow to each other!

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:43.640
Thank you!

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:46.100
Bring it on!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.240
The bases are loaded with no outs.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.990
I'm just not good enough.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.800
I squidly got it!

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:05.760
Squiddie, throw it! Quick!

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:07.290
Uh, got it!

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:12.170
Squiddie, the ball, not the glove!

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.010
I'm sorry...

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:20.010
Don't worry about it.
This is your first time after all.

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:23.170
Kiyomi's so nice.

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:26.380
I can't be her undertow.

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:28.480
We have to win today!

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.100
Ball four!

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:33.290
Runners on first and second again with no outs.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:37.950
And the next batter
is famous: Tanaka!

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.030
Bring it on!

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:45.040
I can't give up!
We're going to win!

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:54.140
I got it!

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:54.960
Out!

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.900
What? No way!

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:59.430
Oh, I've got to throw
it back quickly!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.220
Here I go!

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:08.600
Out!

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:13.170
Out!

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:14.760
The runners on first and second
base are both out!

00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:16.570
It's a triple play!

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:20.970
Nice catch!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.910
They have such an amazing player?

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:29.310
This is getting good!

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:34.210
Strike!

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:36.260
Strike!

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:38.340
Strike!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:39.630
All right!

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:55.550
We're in a tight spot, aren't we?

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:57.650
Kiyomi?

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:02.020
You can't pitch like that.

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:04.620
But we don't have anybody
left who can pitch...

00:19:04.890 --> 00:19:06.330
I'll do it.

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:08.220
Squiddie?

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:11.400
Basically, they're not allowed
to hit the ball, right?

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:13.750
Yeah, but...

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:17.300
Leave it to me.
I'll strike them out!

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:21.010
Okay! We're counting
on you, Squiddie!

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:24.970
Let's do this.

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:27.270
I hope she'll be okay.

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:30.940
Try hitting this!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:34.020
Strike!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:37.900
Wow! I wonder if that's
even allowed...

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:39.860
Strike! Batter out.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:41.820
Strike! Batter out.

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:46.280
Hah, so nobody can
hit my squid balls?

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.330
I'll give it a shot.

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:53.420
It's her. Let's have our
showdown, shall we?!

00:19:56.210 --> 00:20:01.470
She's not bad.
But this is it!

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:08.760
Gotcha!

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:14.150
I did it!

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:14.150
Strike! Out!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:15.820
Nice pitching!

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:17.810
All right, now let's score
some runs and win!

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:23.280
Runners on first and second.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:26.160
I'm going to hit it and
get us some runs!

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:30.100
Got it!

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:32.210
Oh no, that was a weak grounder
to the pitcher!

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:33.290
First!

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:36.000
Safe!

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:40.160
Yay! Good luck, Squid Extraordinaire!

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.210
I got this!

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.670
Okay, time to hit some
squidly balls.

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:47.890
This one's safe.
She can pitch, but she won't hit these.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.470
Squiddie, you can do it!

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:54.310
Kiyomi!

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:56.150
This is the last ball!

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:56.940
Oh crap!

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:16.960
A walk-off grand slam!

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.920
Tentacles for the win!

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:22.810
Wait! Please go around
the bases first!

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:27.930
We did it!

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:27.930
Yeah!

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:29.410
We lost fair and square.

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:31.290
That last home run was amazing.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.070
You really are a great player.

00:21:33.070 --> 00:21:34.390
It's natural for a squid!

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:38.250
I wish she was actually
on our team...

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:41.140
She's not part of our team,

00:21:41.140 --> 00:21:42.820
she's just helping out today.

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:43.860
I want her...

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:47.570
Then, please join our team!

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:51.720
With you, taking the national
cup isn't just a dream!

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:52.680
Please!

00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:56.050
I'm not a middle schooler!

00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:58.050
Please join us!

00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:05.040
No way! Let me squid-invade!

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:06.510
Wait!

00:23:42.390 --> 00:23:44.690
Hello. I'm Sakura Kiyomi.

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:45.520
Next time:

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:47.360
I ink that's a doll?

00:23:47.360 --> 00:23:48.700
Isn't that fishy?

00:23:48.700 --> 00:23:50.160
Squids to match my mountains.

00:23:51.140 --> 00:23:53.490
Okay, I'm off to morning practice!
